      <h2 class="item-overline pt-1 pt-lg-3 pb-lg-2">2026-27</h2>
    
      <div class="content-wrapper">
      
<div class="block-content block-content--type-basic block-content--38611 block-content--view-mode-full">
  
  
  <div class="block-content__content">
    
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><table class="table"><caption>Fall 2026 Calendar</caption><thead><tr><th style="width:20%;">Date(s)</th><th style="width:20%;">Day(s)</th><th style="width:60%;">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="width:20%;">August 19-22</td><td style="width:20%;">Wednesday-Saturday</td><td style="width:60%;">New Student Arrival &amp; Orientation</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">August 24</td><td style="width:20%;">Monday</td><td style="width:60%;">Classes Begin</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">September 7</td><td style="width:20%;">Monday</td><td style="width:60%;">Labor Day. No classes.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">September 21</td><td style="width:20%;">Monday</td><td style="width:60%;"><span class="ckeditor-tooltip-text" data-tippy-content='&lt;span class="tooltip-title"&gt;Grow, Thrive, Live Day&lt;/span&gt;Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success.' data-tooltip-title="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-content="Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success." data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection="true" data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection-text="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-data="%5B%7B%22tooltipTitle%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%2C%22tooltipContent%22%3A%22Classes%20will%20not%20meet%20on%20Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20(GTL)%20Days%2C%20which%20will%20provide%20opportunities%20for%20faculty%2C%20staff%2C%20and%20students%20to%20come%20together%20in%20community%20and%20engage%20in%20activities%20that%20strengthen%20our%20academic%20enterprise%20and%20support%20student%20success.%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelection%22%3A%22true%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelectionText%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%7D%5D">Grow, Thrive, Live Day</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">October 15</td><td style="width:20%;">Thursday</td><td style="width:60%;"><span class="ckeditor-tooltip-text" data-tippy-content='&lt;span class="tooltip-title"&gt;Grow, Thrive, Live Day&lt;/span&gt;Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success.' data-tooltip-title="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-content="Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success." data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection="true" data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection-text="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-data="%5B%7B%22tooltipTitle%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%2C%22tooltipContent%22%3A%22Classes%20will%20not%20meet%20on%20Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20(GTL)%20Days%2C%20which%20will%20provide%20opportunities%20for%20faculty%2C%20staff%2C%20and%20students%20to%20come%20together%20in%20community%20and%20engage%20in%20activities%20that%20strengthen%20our%20academic%20enterprise%20and%20support%20student%20success.%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelection%22%3A%22true%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelectionText%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%7D%5D">Grow, Thrive, Live Day</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">November 3</td><td style="width:20%;">Tuesday</td><td style="width:60%;"><span class="ckeditor-tooltip-text" data-tippy-content='&lt;span class="tooltip-title"&gt;Grow, Thrive, Live Day&lt;/span&gt;Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success.' data-tooltip-title="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-content="Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success." data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection="true" data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection-text="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-data="%5B%7B%22tooltipTitle%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%2C%22tooltipContent%22%3A%22Classes%20will%20not%20meet%20on%20Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20(GTL)%20Days%2C%20which%20will%20provide%20opportunities%20for%20faculty%2C%20staff%2C%20and%20students%20to%20come%20together%20in%20community%20and%20engage%20in%20activities%20that%20strengthen%20our%20academic%20enterprise%20and%20support%20student%20success.%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelection%22%3A%22true%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelectionText%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%7D%5D">Grow, Thrive, Live Day</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">November 23-27</td><td style="width:20%;">Monday-Friday</td><td style="width:60%;">Break (No Classes)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">December 9</td><td style="width:20%;">Wednesday</td><td style="width:60%;">Follow a Monday class schedule</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">December 11</td><td style="width:20%;">Friday</td><td style="width:60%;">Study Day</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">December 13</td><td style="width:20%;">Sunday</td><td style="width:60%;">Commencement</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">December 14-18</td><td style="width:20%;">Monday-Friday</td><td style="width:60%;">Finals Week</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">December 19-21</td><td style="width:20%;">Saturday-Sunday</td><td style="width:60%;">Dates reserved for campus-wide final exam rescheduling, as determined by the President's Office or designee</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      
