l not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success.' data-tooltip-title="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-content="Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success." data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection="true" data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection-text="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-data="%5B%7B%22tooltipTitle%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%2C%22tooltipContent%22%3A%22Classes%20will%20not%20meet%20on%20Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20(GTL)%20Days%2C%20which%20will%20provide%20opportunities%20for%20faculty%2C%20staff%2C%20and%20students%20to%20come%20together%20in%20community%20and%20engage%20in%20activities%20that%20strengthen%20our%20academic%20enterprise%20and%20support%20student%20success.%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelection%22%3A%22true%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelectionText%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%7D%5D">Grow, Thrive, Live Day</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">April 23</td><td style="width:20%;">Friday</td><td style="width:60%;"><span class="ckeditor-tooltip-text" data-tippy-content='&lt;span class="tooltip-title"&gt;Grow, Thrive, Live Day&lt;/span&gt;Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success.' data-tooltip-title="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-content="Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success." data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection="true" data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection-text="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-data="%5B%7B%22tooltipTitle%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%2C%22tooltipContent%22%3A%22Classes%20will%20not%20meet%20on%20Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20(GTL)%20Days%2C%20which%20will%20provide%20opportunities%20for%20faculty%2C%20staff%2C%20and%20students%20to%20come%20together%20in%20community%20and%20engage%20in%20activities%20that%20strengthen%20our%20academic%20enterprise%20and%20support%20student%20success.%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelection%22%3A%22true%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelectionText%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%7D%5D">Grow, Thrive, Live Day</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">May 4</td><td style="width:20%;">Tuesday</td><td style="width:60%;"><span class="ckeditor-tooltip-text" data-tippy-content='&lt;span class="tooltip-title"&gt;Grow, Thrive, Live Day&lt;/span&gt;Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success.' data-tooltip-title="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-content="Classes will not meet on Grow, Thrive, Live (GTL) Days, which will provide opportunities for faculty, staff, and students to come together in community and engage in activities that strengthen our academic enterprise and support student success." data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection="true" data-tooltip-placeholder-is-selection-text="Grow, Thrive, Live Day" data-tooltip-data="%5B%7B%22tooltipTitle%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%2C%22tooltipContent%22%3A%22Classes%20will%20not%20meet%20on%20Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20(GTL)%20Days%2C%20which%20will%20provide%20opportunities%20for%20faculty%2C%20staff%2C%20and%20students%20to%20come%20together%20in%20community%20and%20engage%20in%20activities%20that%20strengthen%20our%20academic%20enterprise%20and%20support%20student%20success.%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelection%22%3A%22true%22%2C%22placeholderIsSelectionText%22%3A%22Grow%2C%20Thrive%2C%20Live%20Day%22%7D%5D">Grow, Thrive, Live Day</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">May 17-21</td><td style="width:20%;">Monday-Friday</td><td style="width:60%;">Finals Week</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">May 21</td><td style="width:20%;">Friday</td><td style="width:60%;">Masters Commencement Ceremony</td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%;">May 22</td><td style="width:20%;">Saturday</td><td style="width:60%;">Undergraduate Commencement Ceremony</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      
